+ * taken from OmniVision's OV02A10, a sibling part sharing this paged register
+ * architecture and the same 0xfd page-select.
+ *
+ * Determined empirically with tools/cmdq-trace/flip-sweep.sh, which drives
+ * these parameters and compares each capture against the 180-degree rotation
